  <section><title>Activity</title>
<para>A <term data-schema-version="1.0" data-store="glossary-tooltip">discrete function</term> has distinct separate values in the domain and range, rather than an interval of values.</para>
<list class="os-raise-noindent" type="enumerated">
  <item>Below is a graph from the previous lesson that graphs the number of students attending a camp and the amount, in dollars, the camp earns. There must be 5 students to hold the camp.</item>
</list>
<para><image alt="A graph. " src="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/8e212f8010016b9ef2ed559709268813ad1477b2"/></para>
<br/>
<br/>
<!--Text Entry Interaction Start -->
<exercise><exercise>
